{"synopsis":"Di akhir kehidupan saya yang sakit parah saya mendapati diri saya bereinkarnasi sebagai seekor naga dalam sebuah webtoon Sekali lagi hidup dengan penyakit mematikan tapi kali ini sebagai seekor naga\nLois terlahir dengan warisan makhluk terkuat di dunia dengan kekayaan dan umur ribuan tahun sebagai naga\nNamun menghadapi krisis yang tak terduga di setiap kesempatan tidak tahu kapan saya akan matibualan macam apa ini\nTerlalu tidak adil jika aku mati dengan tenang seperti ini Memanfaatkan pengetahuan masa depan yang saya miliki saya akan bertahan hidup seperti penjahat dan memberikan cerita ini sebuah perubahan","alternative_title":"시한부 드래곤의 생존법","author":"Jeong Hoon-Il, Red Leaf","artist":"Popiseu","chapters":[{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"3a0172ed-e815-4382-a5d3-339b943ef98b","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"14dedeb3-a34f-4599-8baf-dc67b69b642f","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"49fc0f0c-19f5-413a-bed7-cc45dd05e676","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2024-11-25"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"addc0340-49ed-41e0-87d0-2ad0b7fa3b78","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2024-11-25"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"f0a82885-693e-4d26-a0b6-ff8a584071e7","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2024-11-25"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"3e30d3fa-312f-40d7-8b5a-b6ccfe9058e4","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2024-11-25"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"c8b36905-989c-433a-9177-2311d5b32501","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2024-11-25"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"4dd1c1d3-2c03-4825-998e-0678ba0cd24e","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"a02efdd9-0bca-4d10-9979-f916abfa5358","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2024-11-25"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"669b92ec-4449-4d36-9b2f-b67e47ba5597","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2024-11-25"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"98e5b3a4-1bc2-424a-867b-89d8b98ebed2","title":"Ch